{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國《衞報》10月22日報道，幾個月前，在谷歌到來之前，芬蘭北部鄉村穆霍斯鎮附近330公頃（3.3平方千米）的森林裏估計有25萬棵樹。如今，它們全部消失了。這家科技公司為建設數據中心非法清除了整片區域，甚至連表土都一併挖走。居民們説，從工地流出的褐色泥水正流入一條最終匯入奧盧約基河的溪流。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583530.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.816112+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:36:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"f282b9a710fe699b77c459f391969ac5fd73148fd6086a9d62e608a194e461fd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}